{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主愛不移"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「不生育、未生養的婦人啊，要歡唱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未曾生產的女子啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要歡呼高歌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為沒有丈夫的比有丈夫的兒女更多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要擴大你支帳篷的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘量鋪開帳篷的幔子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"放長繩子，釘牢橛子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你要向左右擴展，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的後裔要佔據列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使荒涼的城邑重新有人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"「不要害怕，因為你不會再受羞辱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要恐懼，因為你不會再受凌辱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必忘記年輕時的羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再想起寡居時的恥辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為造你的是你的丈夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂名叫萬軍之耶和華；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的救贖主是以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被稱為普天下的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華要召你回來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同召一個遭遺棄、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中憂傷的少妻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你的上帝說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我丟棄了你片刻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要懷著極大的憐憫接你回來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我盛怒之下暫時掩面不理你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要以永遠不變的慈愛憐憫你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你的救贖主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「這對我而言就像挪亞的時代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎樣起誓不再讓挪亞時代的洪水淹沒大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也照樣起誓不再向你發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再斥責你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山可以挪開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山可以遷移，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的慈愛必不離開你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我平安的約也不會更改。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是憐憫你的耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「困苦不堪、飽經風雨、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得不著安慰的城啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要以彩石作你的地基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用藍寶石建造你的根基，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用紅寶石建你的城樓、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水晶造你的城門、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寶石建你的城牆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女都必受耶和華的訓誨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安享太平。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因公義而堅立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再不會受欺壓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會擔驚受怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為恐懼不會臨近你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倘若有人來攻打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那必不是我的旨意。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打你的必然失敗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，是我造了煽旺炭火、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鑄造合用兵器的鐵匠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我造了毀滅者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為攻擊你而造的兵器必不能奏效，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必駁倒所有控告你的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華眾僕人的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我給他們的勝利","poem":1},{"noteId":24},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"「勝利」或譯「公義」。","reference":{"chapter":54,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}